---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | PregWeeks"
  description="Read the PregWeeks Terms of Service. Understand the terms, guidelines, and limitations of using our site and interactive trackers."
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#0066cc] transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span class="text-neutral-300">/</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-700 font-medium">Terms of Service</span>
    </nav>

    <article class="space-y-8 prose prose-neutral max-w-none text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      <header class="border-b border-neutral-200 pb-6">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-2">Last Updated: June 7, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using <strong class="text-neutral-900">PregWeeks.com</strong>, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our website or services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">2. Medical Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="bg-red-50 text-red-950 border border-red-200 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold leading-relaxed">
          The educational content and client-side utilities provided on PregWeeks.com do not constitute medical advice, diagnostics, or clinical treatment recommendations. All tools, trackers, and guides are intended for personal planning and general educational tracking purposes. Always seek the advice of a qualified physician regarding pregnancy symptoms or health changes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">3. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          You are granted a limited, personal, non-commercial right to use our calculators and download generated milestone cards. You may not scrape, frame, or replicate our datasets (such as our baby names list or food safety database) without explicit written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          PregWeeks.com is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties regarding the accuracy of calculations (e.g. estimated due dates, ovulation timelines) or safety lists, and accept no liability for decisions made based on our content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">5. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding these terms, email: <a href="mailto:terms@pregweeks.com" class="text-[#0066cc] hover:underline">terms@pregweeks.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
